Feeding proprietary data into a public AI model could mean handing your most valuable asset to the company that trained it.

@rajuv, Chief Evangelist @Zoho, spoke with @Brad_Shimmin about what digital sovereignty demands as AI adoption accelerates.

His question for every enterprise: are you a customer, or are you a hostage? @Zoho_USA @InfluenceZoho

